{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-components-1-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"11","surface":"phone","area":"phone/components-1","refs":["F-phone-1312","F-phone-1310"],"severity":"S3","title":"The watch update pop-up never shows while the member has put off a phone update","what":"The watch pop-up waits for the phone's own update to go first. But it treats the phone update as still waiting for as long as any newer phone version exists, even after the member tapped Later on it and only the small orange line is left. A member who keeps putting off the phone update is never told the watch app is behind, however many weeks pass, and the pop-up's log only says it is waiting.","expected":"The watch pop-up waits only while the phone's own full-screen update is up (or for that one open), then offers the watch update on a later open even if the phone update was put off.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/components/WatchUpdatePrompt.tsx:193","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/watchUpdateCard.ts:139","apps/mobile/src/lib/updateStore.ts:216","apps/mobile/src/lib/updateStore.ts:258"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"watch-popup-waits-for-phone-update","who":"members with a MettleUp watch who put off a phone update","how_often":"every open while a phone update is waiting","fix_line":"Let the watch pop-up wait only for the phone's full-screen update itself, not for the orange line","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
